## 📊 Data Models and APIs

### Core Security Models
```python
class SecurityScan(models.Model):
    """Comprehensive security scan tracking"""
    id = models.UUIDField(primary_key=True, default=uuid.uuid4)
    organization = models.ForeignKey(Organization, on_delete=models.CASCADE)
    target_url = models.URLField()
    scan_type = models.CharField(max_length=50)
    status = models.CharField(max_length=20, choices=SCAN_STATUS_CHOICES)
    created_at = models.DateTimeField(auto_now_add=True)
    completed_at = models.DateTimeField(null=True, blank=True)
    
class Vulnerability(models.Model):
    """Individual vulnerability finding"""
    scan = models.ForeignKey(SecurityScan, related_name='vulnerabilities')
    name = models.CharField(max_length=200)
    risk_level = models.CharField(max_length=20)
    owasp_category = models.CharField(max_length=50)
    ai_analysis = models.JSONField(default=dict)
```

### API Endpoint Structure
- `/api/v1/scans/` - Security scan management
- `/api/v1/vulnerabilities/` - Vulnerability tracking
- `/api/v1/compliance/` - OWASP compliance reporting
